e":"穰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"r2f_mtq_05s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m005-0208","start":208,"end":210,"surface":"華陽","kind":"person","person_id":"4tv_nhj_oxt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m005-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"四君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、普通類稱或未定對象不補姓名；人犬不當特定人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m005-0255","start":255,"end":257,"surface":"四君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、普通類稱或未定對象不補姓名；人犬不當特定人物。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi","book_id":"b-shiji-087","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-087-lisi"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:p002","text":"當晉昭公時，諸大夫彊而公族弱，趙簡子為大夫，專國事。簡子疾，五日不知人，大夫皆懼，於是召扁鵲。扁鵲入視病，出，董安于問扁鵲，扁鵲曰：「血脈治也，而何怪！昔秦穆公嘗如此，七日而寤。寤之日，告公孫支與子輿曰：『我之帝所甚樂。吾所以久者，適有所學也。帝告我：「晉國且大亂，五世不安。其後將霸，未老而死。霸者之子且令而國男女無別。」』公孫支書而藏之，秦策於是出。夫獻公之亂，文公之霸，而襄公敗秦師於殽而歸縱淫，此子之所聞。今主君之病與之同，不出三日必閒，閒必有言也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"晉昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"趙簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"p4b_qf7_603_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"p4b_qf7_603_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"扁鵲","kind":"person","person_id":"6hq_bb2_3rb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"董安于","kind":"person","person_id":"t2m_90g_lng","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-105-bianque:m002-0059","start":59,